            "review_title": "Review at Propeller Rooftop Bar HCM",
            "review_text": "extravelagent\nHonolulu, Hawaii444 contributions\n0\nGreat rooftop bar!\nOct 2019 • Couples\nThis was the rooftop on top of our hotel - the Bay hotel HCMC. Awesome views, practically empty every time we went, good prices on drinks and skewers. Nice atmosphere and sweet , attentive English speaking staff. Several times we wanted to go to a rooftop bar and we just decided to go back to our hotel since we knew we would have the place to Ourselves and not get gouged on drinks and food. Not sure if you are not staying in the area “Japan town “ that you would go here but we thoroughly enjoyed each time we went . Again, awesome views and even of the “Tower”on the far side. Kiss Kiss Kiss!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 25, 2019",
